{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/c5ceacaf7ad134d4bbbaa512b4428e03.poster.avif?t=1770205436\" width=491 height=139 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/c5ceacaf7ad134d4bbbaa512b4428e03.webm?t=1770205436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Kasasaburo's Secret Fishing Spot&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > is a <strong>desktop idle pixel fishing game</strong>.You will meet the mysterious frog angler, Samur\u014d, and spend quiet days by the lake catching all kinds of curious fish, selling them for coins, upgrading your gear, and building your very own secret fishing spot.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Samur\u014d\u2019s Secret Fishing Spot</i> is a <strong>relaxing, heartwarming little game full of calm, comfort, and gentle presence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/87763a0b5f81152d60245360bd9d8e5f.avif?t=1770205436\" width=864 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Rods and Baits, Each with Unique Effects</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing rods affect the weight of fish you can catch, how deep you can go, and may even trigger certain hidden events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bait is not only used to attract specific types of fish\u2014some can also increase the value of fish and bring unexpected changes. How to combine them and what to fish for is up to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/a87022a31aed5b8f0e0d730c6d1c8d14.avif?t=1770205436\" width=864 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taste a Range of Japanese Sake\u2014 alcohol isn\u2019t just for getting drunk</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some sake change the world around you once you finish them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some double your stamina.And others quietly boost your fishing efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thinking too much won\u2019t help. When worries start creeping in, stop overthinking\u2014 just drink!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/823d01cb78922529397fc1d16e1dc9d1.avif?t=1770205436\" width=864 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every cast of the line is an exploration into the secrets of the sea.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the common little fish to the strange and rare ones, countless beings dwell beneath the waves. Some appear only under certain conditions, all waiting for players to discover them on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond fish, the sea occasionally offers up something extraordinary\u2014lost treasures, or messages in bottles that carry hidden secrets. With each cast, players slowly piece together a more complete picture of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/70488f31dac61f420e2a4499ecc5cba2.avif?t=1770205436\" width=864 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World IP Collaborations as In-Game Merchants</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creators and brands from the real world appear as mysterious merchants deep in the forest.<br>They offer exclusive bait, rods, sake, and even limited-edition items and decorations.<br>Each merchant brings something different, and you never know who you\u2019ll meet next.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2115670?t=1770205436","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2115670?t=1770205436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/ce75638b46906737d8635ecf1aa295e37b4dec4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770205436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/ce75638b46906737d8635ecf1aa295e37b4dec4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770205436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/c5ceacaf7ad134d4bbbaa512b4428e03.poster.avif?t=1770205436\" width=491 height=139 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/c5ceacaf7ad134d4bbbaa512b4428e03.webm?t=1770205436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Kasasaburo's Secret Fishing Spot&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > is a <strong>desktop idle pixel fishing game</strong>.You will meet the mysterious frog angler, Samur\u014d, and spend quiet days by the lake catching all kinds of curious fish, selling them for coins, upgrading your gear, and building your very own secret fishing spot.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Samur\u014d\u2019s Secret Fishing Spot</i> is a <strong>relaxing, heartwarming little game full of calm, comfort, and gentle presence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/87763a0b5f81152d60245360bd9d8e5f.avif?t=1770205436\" width=864 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Rods and Baits, Each with Unique Effects</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing rods affect the weight of fish you can catch, how deep you can go, and may even trigger certain hidden events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bait is not only used to attract specific types of fish\u2014some can also increase the value of fish and bring unexpected changes. How to combine them and what to fish for is up to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/a87022a31aed5b8f0e0d730c6d1c8d14.avif?t=1770205436\" width=864 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taste a Range of Japanese Sake\u2014 alcohol isn\u2019t just for getting drunk</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some sake change the world around you once you finish them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some double your stamina.And others quietly boost your fishing efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thinking too much won\u2019t help. When worries start creeping in, stop overthinking\u2014 just drink!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/823d01cb78922529397fc1d16e1dc9d1.avif?t=1770205436\" width=864 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every cast of the line is an exploration into the secrets of the sea.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the common little fish to the strange and rare ones, countless beings dwell beneath the waves. Some appear only under certain conditions, all waiting for players to discover them on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond fish, the sea occasionally offers up something extraordinary\u2014lost treasures, or messages in bottles that carry hidden secrets. With each cast, players slowly piece together a more complete picture of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/extras/70488f31dac61f420e2a4499ecc5cba2.avif?t=1770205436\" width=864 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World IP Collaborations as In-Game Merchants</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creators and brands from the real world appear as mysterious merchants deep in the forest.<br>They offer exclusive bait, rods, sake, and even limited-edition items and decorations.<br>Each merchant brings something different, and you never know who you\u2019ll meet next.</p>","developers":["\u8703\u754c\u5c4b MIRAGEHOUSE"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115670/a146be14c10f0c9a37fb3b7014f4a48c93b74f6a/header.jpg?t=1770205436","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2115670/37427504/d01514bb31397308db6997486d132cedb24b6c5f/1760454886/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760455107","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstati